      "locked": false,
      "text": "Baseline \u2014 deterministic rules, always run first",
      "originalText": "Baseline \u2014 deterministic rules, always run first",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rules-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 456.5,
      "width": 868,
      "height": 131.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g-rules"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2052182092,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 822836247,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773320000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every gap in the run becomes a sentence. Skipped or failed adapters, an existence class of\nnot_found or out_of_range (kept distinct), an entity with no knowledge-base page, or a failed URL\nfetch are collected as unknowns.\nFewer than two independent sources, a claim where NLI and Gemini disagree, or clashing entity sets\nare collected as weak-evidence flags.\nThe corroboration state then picks a conservative risk band and recommended label. This payload\nexists before any model is contacted.",
      "originalText": "Every gap in the run becomes a sentence. Skipped or failed adapters, an existence class of not_found or out_of_range (kept distinct), an entity with no knowledge-base page, or a failed URL fetch are collected as unknowns.\n\nFewer than two independent sources, a claim where NLI and Gemini disagree, or clashing entity sets are collected as weak-evidence flags.\n\nThe corroboration state then picks a conservative risk band and recommended label. This payload exists before any model is contacted.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "model",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 416,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g-model"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c5",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 552820323,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1862664905,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "a-blind-model",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "a-model-val",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1773320000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "model-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1036,
      "y": 428,
      "width": 828,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g-model"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1580185442,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 267699228,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773320000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Then a model, only if a provider is ready",
      "originalText": "Then a model, only if a provider is ready",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "model-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1036,
      "y": 456.5,
      "width": 828,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g-model"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 38364398,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1116214496,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773320000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tried in order: OpenAI, then Anthropic, then Gemini. The first provider that answers is used.\nIt receives the structured signals with an explicit instruction that missing tools do not imply\nfabrication.\nIt is told it may not declare the story true or false. It returns unknowns, weak evidence, an\nindependence note, a risk band, a recommended label, and a short rationale.\nIf no provider is configured, or the call or the parse fails, the baseline simply stands.",
      "originalText": "Tried in order: OpenAI, then Anthropic, then Gemini. The first provider that answers is used.\n\nIt receives the structured signals with an explicit instruction that missing tools do not imply fabrication.\n\nIt is told it may not declare the story true or false. It returns unknowns, weak evidence, an independence note, a risk band, a recommended label, and a short rationale.\n\nIf no provider is configured, or the call or the parse fails, the baseline simply stands.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "validate",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 792,
      "width": 1880,
      "height": 168,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
